    "detailed_description": "<strong>Running Guys</strong> is a very small <strong>running game</strong> where a police officer chases a thief.<br><br>This game was developed in two weeks almost 10 years ago and revived recently (as many children enjoyed it at a science fair).<br><br>There is only one level (you should give it a chance :P), but we will rework this game in a few weeks to make it with Unreal Engine (mainly to test exports on different platforms).<br><br>You should definitely grab it now, as it has a low price :P<br><br><br>Little tip, when you just hit the ground after a jump or a fall, do a roll!",
